TI  - A co-workership approach on digital transformation : Towards smart manufacturing
J2  - Proceedings of the International Association for Computer Information Systems - Europe June 23, 2022 : Virtual Conference
T2  - The International Association for Computer Information Systems - Europe June 23, 2022 - Virtual Conference
