TI  - A Good Working Environment : What Psychological Needs To Meet?
J2  - ICERI2024 Proceedings
T2  - 17th annual International Conference of Education, Research and Innovation 11-13 November, 2024, Seville, Spain
AU  - Aggestam, Lena
AU  - Svensson, Ann
