TI  - Teaching vocational pupils in their pyjamas : a socio-material perspective on challenges in the age of Covid-19
AU  - Carlsson, Sandra
AU  - Flensner, Karin K
AU  - Svensson, Lars
AU  - Willermark, Sara
Y1  - 2022///
PY  - 2022
